{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39649230",
      "title": "How NOT to Update the UI - A Look Behind The Scenes of React [Core Concept]",
      "sourceHash": "4144726e4d96171f9f7f5654d2b7a3f62595dcddd8472953bb3853337399aeb0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.99,
          "end": 2.37,
          "en": "So let's now make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.37,
          "end": 4.8,
          "en": "that we output different content here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.8,
          "end": 7.323,
          "en": "depending on which tab button was pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.22,
          "end": 12.84,
          "en": "And for that we could of course, try using a variable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.84,
          "end": 17.25,
          "en": "We could add a variable here in this App Component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.25,
          "end": 19.713,
          "en": "and maybe name it tabContent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.82,
          "end": 25.6,
          "en": "And initially here we could say, please click a button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.54,
          "end": 31.5,
          "en": "but then let's say when handleSelect is executed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 31.5,
          "end": 34.77,
          "en": "we wanna update this tabContent variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 34.77,
          "end": 37.26,
          "en": "and set it equal to the selectedButton.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.26,
          "end": 39.91,
          "en": "So to this identifier, which we're getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 43.65,
          "en": "and that's of course not the final result I want to have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.65,
          "end": 45.693,
          "en": "but it should be a good first step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.62,
          "end": 50.1,
          "en": "So with that, we can then use this tabContent variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.1,
          "end": 54.06,
          "en": "as we learned it before, and output it dynamically down here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.06,
          "end": 56.043,
          "en": "with help of those curly braces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 57.57,
          "end": 59.94,
          "en": "So with that, we're outputting tabContent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.94,
          "end": 63.48,
          "en": "and if we save that, we indeed do see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.48,
          "end": 66.033,
          "en": "please click a button as a starting text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.47,
          "end": 72.47,
          "en": "But what you'll notice is that as you press those buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 72.75,
          "end": 75.78,
          "en": "and I am pressing them here, I am clicking.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.78,
          "end": 77.01,
          "en": "But as I'm doing that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.01,
          "end": 81.27,
          "en": "you'll see that this text here does not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 81.27,
          "end": 82.68299999999999,
          "en": "It stays the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.7,
          "end": 86.223,
          "en": "So it looks as if this code is not working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.72,
          "end": 91.02,
          "en": "And just to be sure that I'm clicking these buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 91.02,
          "end": 94.02000000000001,
          "en": "I'll actually console.log tabContent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 94.02000000000001,
          "end": 96.813,
          "en": "inside of handleSelect after setting it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.61,
          "end": 101.49000000000001,
          "en": "But as I do that, if I reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.49000000000001,
          "end": 105.303,
          "en": "you'll see that I get the log statements on the right here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 106.14,
          "end": 109.86,
          "en": "But this text here is not updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.86,
          "end": 112.53,
          "en": "So clearly the function is executing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 112.53,
          "end": 117.53,
          "en": "and we're updating the variable, but the UI is not updating.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 117.96000000000001,
          "end": 121.38,
          "en": "And the user interface is not updating",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 121.38,
          "end": 126.12,
          "en": "because this App Component function is not executed again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 126.12,
          "end": 129.393,
          "en": "just because this handleSelect function executes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 130.74,
          "end": 131.85,
          "en": "But therefore,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 131.85,
          "end": 135.21,
          "en": "since the App function is not executing again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 135.21,
          "end": 140.21,
          "en": "this entire JSX code here is not getting reevaluated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 140.85,
          "end": 145.03,
          "en": "So it still only knows the initial tabContent value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 146.07,
          "end": 149.25,
          "en": "because this code must get reevaluated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 149.25,
          "end": 153.81,
          "en": "by React in order for the UI to be updated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 153.81,
          "end": 157.8,
          "en": "because React in the end takes a look at this JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 161.49,
          "en": "and it compares it to the currently rendered UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 161.49,
          "end": 163.95,
          "en": "And if it detects any differences",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 163.95,
          "end": 166.413,
          "en": "it will update the UI accordingly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 169.05,
          "end": 173.76,
          "en": "But of course here, since this code only gets executed once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 173.76,
          "end": 176.07,
          "en": "the new content is never picked up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 176.07,
          "end": 178.203,
          "en": "and the UI is never updated.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 179.13,
          "end": 180.24,
          "en": "Because by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 180.24,
          "end": 182.82,
          "en": "and that's really important to keep in mind,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 182.82,
          "end": 187.77,
          "en": "React will only execute a Component function once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 187.77,
          "end": 191.7,
          "en": "when it's first encountered somewhere in your code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 191.7,
          "end": 194.01,
          "en": "So the App Component function, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 194.01,
          "end": 197.73,
          "en": "is first encountered in the index JSX file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 197.73,
          "end": 200.46,
          "en": "And that's there for the point in time where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 200.46,
          "end": 203.88,
          "en": "React executes that function and renders it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 203.88,
          "end": 206.55,
          "en": "And the TabButton Component, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 206.55,
          "end": 208.41,
          "en": "is first encountered when",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 208.41,
          "end": 211.38,
          "en": "that App Component is executed and rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 211.38,
          "end": 214.11,
          "en": "So that's when the TabButton Component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 214.11,
          "end": 216.27,
          "en": "will be executed and rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 216.27,
          "end": 217.32,
          "en": "But thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 217.32,
          "end": 220.803,
          "en": "neither of these functions will be re executed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 221.82,
          "end": 224.55,
          "en": "And you can see that and understand that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 224.55,
          "end": 226.86,
          "en": "if you add a console.log statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 226.86,
          "end": 230.31,
          "en": "right inside of the App Component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.31,
          "end": 232.56,
          "en": "So not inside of handleSelect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.56,
          "end": 235.07999999999998,
          "en": "but inside of the App Component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.07999999999998,
          "end": 239.67000000000002,
          "en": "And there we could log App Component rendering",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 239.67000000000002,
          "end": 242.613,
          "en": "or executing whatever you want, it's the same.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 244.32,
          "end": 246,
          "en": "So we could log this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 246,
          "end": 249.393,
          "en": "and we could also log this in a TabButton for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 250.47,
          "end": 254.403,
          "en": "And here we wanna say TabButton Component executing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 255.63,
          "end": 258.24,
          "en": "And if you do that, you'll see that if you save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 258.24,
          "end": 259.62,
          "en": "and you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 259.62,
          "end": 263.793,
          "en": "you see App Component executing being output once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 264.69,
          "end": 268.17,
          "en": "and you see TabButton Component executing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 268.17,
          "end": 272.493,
          "en": "being output four times because we have four such buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 274.77,
          "end": 277.56,
          "en": "So therefore, indeed the TabButton Component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 277.56,
          "end": 280.23,
          "en": "is encountered four times in the UI.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 280.23,
          "end": 283.89,
          "en": "And React will execute the respective Component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 283.89,
          "end": 287.013,
          "en": "for every time it encounters it in the JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 288.65999999999997,
          "end": 292.53,
          "en": "But you'll also see that as I press one of these buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 292.53,
          "end": 297.24,
          "en": "these log messages here are not print it again",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 297.24,
          "end": 299.1,
          "en": "only these other log messages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 299.1,
          "end": 302.19,
          "en": "from inside the event handler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 302.19,
          "end": 305.67,
          "en": "And that's therefore why updating the UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 305.67,
          "end": 309.51,
          "en": "with a regular variable like this, does not work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 309.51,
          "end": 314.01,
          "en": "because this Component function is not executing again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.01,
          "end": 317.25,
          "en": "So what we need is a way of telling React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 317.25,
          "end": 320.76,
          "en": "that this Component function should be executed again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 320.76,
          "end": 323.49,
          "en": "And that's exactly what the very important concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 323.49,
          "end": 325.47,
          "en": "of state is all about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 325.47,
          "end": 327.873,
          "en": "And we'll explore that concept next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}